# Nightfall: rules for per-app traffic accounting.
# Format:  Name|domains separated by spaces|IP prefixes separated by spaces (optional)
# A domain matches the name itself and all its subdomains; * in a domain is a name pattern. An IP prefix is needed for services without a DNS query (Telegram).
# Custom rules can be added to /etc/nightfall-apps.list (same format): they are checked first.
